                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "df62276c-ac0e-3df5-9e9d-d074574410d1",
                        "entry_id": "7e18a65b-1bce-3513-a588-101a5ace2932",
                        "glosses": [
                            "религ. член родственной баптизму протестантской секты, отличающийся от баптистов тем, что его вероучение основывается лишь на евангельских (новозаветных) текстах, и считающий, что спасение уготовано всем, кто верит в искупительную жертву Христа"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3fb686f-6a1c-4c84-9705-d7907391e227",
                                "sense_id": "df62276c-ac0e-3df5-9e9d-d074574410d1",
                                "text": "Он был хорош и близок с Острожским, принимал деятельное участие в конфедерациях православных и евангеликов."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "645bc745-71cb-4b34-a847-d350bad92a7e",
                        "source_entry_id": "7e18a65b-1bce-3513-a588-101a5ace2932",
                        "source_sense_id": "df62276c-ac0e-3df5-9e9d-d074574410d1",
                        "target_lang_word": "evangelical",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "evangelical",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f091c7f4-8b27-394e-99e4-1ec8f759a114",
                                        "entry_id": "28baa021-4b92-3408-ad8f-5883eeb3bd7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to the doctrines or teachings of the Christian gospel or Christianity in general."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "664eb37b-30a6-3fdf-8579-4d0bd2580d9e",
                                        "entry_id": "28baa021-4b92-3408-ad8f-5883eeb3bd7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to the gospel(s) of the Christian New Testament."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5658844b-34d4-3518-846e-9b662cb95508",
                                        "entry_id": "28baa021-4b92-3408-ad8f-5883eeb3bd7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Protestant; specifically Lutheran and Calvinist churches in continental Europe as well as their offshoots in North America."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "14db5b59-da2b-372e-a9ed-ddb3f872dbab",
                                        "entry_id": "28baa021-4b92-3408-ad8f-5883eeb3bd7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to a movement in Protestant Christianity that stresses personal conversion and the authority of the Bible (evangelicalism)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c647a2e8-1858-48ec-a300-5c980dc62381",
                                                "sense_id": "14db5b59-da2b-372e-a9ed-ddb3f872dbab",
                                                "text": "“They wave their Bibles at passersby, screaming their condemnations,” writes Kurt Eichenwald of evangelical Christians."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "291af922-59b9-3fb4-a4d7-e8c0fa0384d4",
                                        "entry_id": "28baa021-4b92-3408-ad8f-5883eeb3bd7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to Islamic groups that are dedicated to dawah and preaching the Quran and sunnah."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfda4121-370f-4ecc-a155-641850097175",
                                                "sense_id": "291af922-59b9-3fb4-a4d7-e8c0fa0384d4",
                                                "text": "When the mosque came under the influence of an evangelical Muslim group (Jamaati Tableegh), the formerly congenial situation changed noticeably."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "620676b5-f367-3a32-a156-37eb2331bba3",
                                        "entry_id": "28baa021-4b92-3408-ad8f-5883eeb3bd7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Zealously enthusiastic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "evangelical",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b60c92e3-fc33-373f-beaf-a2e4951d6881",
                                        "entry_id": "05b2b01e-0936-3637-ac3b-bf0708950593",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of an evangelical church."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d7c2314-640a-493f-a6fc-d34d67542e7e",
                                                "sense_id": "b60c92e3-fc33-373f-beaf-a2e4951d6881",
                                                "text": "Furthermore, what would otherwise be good points about the sort of selective literalism that renders homosexuality an unpardonable sin but shrugs off Sarah Palin’s biblically forbidden pearl earrings are lost in Eichenwald’s assumption that evangelicals make these decisions “with less care than they exercise in selecting side orders for lunch.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26b2dffb-c704-3b1a-96ad-d3e7a60f19a3",
                                        "entry_id": "05b2b01e-0936-3637-ac3b-bf0708950593",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An advocate of evangelicalism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ccbd38bd-6031-446e-9178-36a12551f693",
                        "source_entry_id": "7e18a65b-1bce-3513-a588-101a5ace2932",
                        "source_sense_id": "df62276c-ac0e-3df5-9e9d-d074574410d1",
                        "target_lang_word": "evangelist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "evangelist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e749259c-c685-3b71-9f99-7c309d288ebb",
                                        "entry_id": "ddc23371-2d54-354c-92ab-05316ff4f4fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An itinerant or special preacher, especially a revivalist, who conducts services in different cities or locations, now often televised."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a9b91046-6db1-3a47-b7e1-2186662fa33c",
                                        "entry_id": "ddc23371-2d54-354c-92ab-05316ff4f4fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A writer of a gospel, especially the four New Testament Gospels (Matthew, Mark, Luke, and John), usually capitalized (Evangelist)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b84ab25c-9588-3f3d-acab-38aeaa88d256",
                                        "entry_id": "ddc23371-2d54-354c-92ab-05316ff4f4fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who first brought the gospel to a city or region."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "abd0baa6-d662-3d1c-ae92-d45aea0770b6",
                                        "entry_id": "ddc23371-2d54-354c-92ab-05316ff4f4fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A patriarch."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bdf17cdd-5345-366e-9e24-d26be5a9bff3",
                                        "entry_id": "ddc23371-2d54-354c-92ab-05316ff4f4fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person marked by extreme enthusiasm for or support of any cause, particularly with regard to religion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6803c86-4e1b-4152-8a2d-e724c14e9986",
                                                "sense_id": "bdf17cdd-5345-366e-9e24-d26be5a9bff3",
                                                "text": "Booth, William (1829-1912) English evangelist; founder and first general of the Salvation Army ... his subordinates being expected to give him unquestioning obedience."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65a8ba74-4ab6-4bda-ba46-ae62289b1259",
                                                "sense_id": "bdf17cdd-5345-366e-9e24-d26be5a9bff3",
                                                "text": "Yet in the spreading consumer market of the mid-1700s, his renditions competed with others offering a far different account of the evangelist and his message. The famous artist William Hogarth mocked Whitefield in two engravings presenting the revivalist as a religious fanatic who held sway over the superstitious lower orders."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45eacb29-d9aa-416f-92d6-1ad9232d4bc9",
                                                "sense_id": "bdf17cdd-5345-366e-9e24-d26be5a9bff3",
                                                "text": "The film implies that the evangelist, as a type, is a fanatic, a sanctimonious prig, and ultimately a hypocrite."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ee3a252-7b97-4a67-9842-6ec21918035f",
                                                "sense_id": "bdf17cdd-5345-366e-9e24-d26be5a9bff3",
                                                "text": "Hendy has come out as something of an evangelist for discontinuous electrification. For Waterloo-Exeter, this could make real sense on a route where the high capital cost of wiring or third rail all the way to Devon would be prohibitive. But what about his vocal support for it on East West Rail, which is effectively a brand new line?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c4a15b7-441c-3831-83d5-8759d30976f3",
                                        "entry_id": "ddc23371-2d54-354c-92ab-05316ff4f4fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person hired to promote a particular technology."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bed61c69-dcfd-4705-ab80-3a678df2036e",
                                                "sense_id": "2c4a15b7-441c-3831-83d5-8759d30976f3",
                                                "text": "developer evangelist"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4774496f-27f0-4951-97c0-86451b0b834e",
                                                "sense_id": "2c4a15b7-441c-3831-83d5-8759d30976f3",
                                                "text": "[…] and has worked in multiple roles, including as the C# Product Manager and as a Developer Evangelist in the Mid-Atlantic district."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "45488ef7-abba-4f03-a58f-c7cba3378296",
                        "source_entry_id": "7e18a65b-1bce-3513-a588-101a5ace2932",
